-v1","count_precision":"exact"},"post_kind":"original","text":"Ivanka caught up with Bret and Holly backstage. Both Bret and Holly were champions all the way. http://bit.ly/ckmKKU","text_truncated":false,"source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"text_source":{"provider":"3dl-kaggle-v1"},"content_status":"text","text_status":"available"},{"id":"x:14628551705","post_id":"14628551705","platform":"x","original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14628551705","published_at":"2010-05-24T15:03:21.000Z","published_date":"2010-05-24","permalink":"https://nanalab.kr/trump-says/posts/x-14628551705.html","like_count":20,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T08:52:18.948296+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"3dl-kaggle-v1","count_precision":"exact"},"post_kind":"original","text":"Congratulations to Bret Michaels, the new Celebrity Apprentice. Bret's a true champion, all of us were happy to see him and to see him win!","text_truncated":false,"source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"text_source":{"provider":"3dl-kaggle-v1"},"content_status":"text","text_status":"available"},{"id":"x:14429237277","post_id":"14429237277","platform":"x","original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14429237277","published_at":"2010-05-21T13:54:57.000Z","published_date":"2010-05-21","permalink":"https://nanalab.kr/trump-says/posts/x-14429237277.html","like_count":22,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T08:52:18.948296+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"3dl-kaggle-v1","count_precision":"exact"},"post_kind":"original","text":"Who's your pick--@bretmichaels or @hollyrpeete ? Vote now on Ivanka's new Facebook page! http://ow.ly/1NfMt","text_truncated":false,"source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"text_source":{"provider":"3dl-kaggle-v1"},"content_status":"text","text_status":"available"},{"id":"x:14371483646","post_id":"14371483646","platform":"x","original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/14371483646","published_at":"2010-05-20T16:22:40.000Z","published_date":"2010-05-20","permalink":"https://nanalab.kr/trump-says/pos